    "text": {
     "en": "Shapes that match exactly in size and shape are congruent. One can be moved, turned or flipped to lie on the other.\nCongruent line segments have equal lengths and congruent angles have equal measures.\nTwo triangles are congruent if their matching sides and angles are equal."
    }
